  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAMPAIGN IN SUPPORT OF RECOMMENDATIONS OF TRUTH AND RECONCILIATION COMMISSION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Campaign (Never Again!)in support of recommendations of the Truth and Reconciliation Commission for rebuillding Peru after the 20-year dirty war between the state and the Shining Path guerrillas.  This work is important because Peruvian governments have been extremely lukewarm in their support for the TRC recommendations for reform of institutions and economic redistribution.</narrative>
  </description>
